  "notes": "Book ranges turned into midpoints; each ingredient note shows the book's range. Wheat flour type 550 → all-purpose. The chart's poolish 40 has no reference mark; read as 40 % of the total dough, which comes closest to the book's 'poolish = 50 % of the total liquid'. Best for crisp, tender crusts.",
